SUMMARY:30th Anniversary Weekend at Zoetropolis
DESCRIPTION:2026 marks Zoetropolis’ 30th year in business. To celebrate this milestone\, we have thrown together a weekend full of Zoetropolis fun! \n\n\n\nFRIDAY: \n\n\n\n4:00-7:00 PM: Lancaster’s Gayest Happy Hour in restaurant and snug bar \n\n\n\n6:30-8:30 PM: Zoetropolis Story Slam in theater \n\n\n\n9:00 PM: First Friday Fright Night: The Greasy Strangler in theater \n\n\n\nSATURDAY: \n\n\n\n11:00-12:00 PM: Zoga on the patio \n\n\n\n1:00-3:00 PM: Art and Lunch with PCAD \n\n\n\n1:00-2:30: Fantastic Fungi \n\n\n\n3:00-4:00: One Minute Film Festival \n\n\n\n4:30-5:30: One Minute Film Festival \n\n\n\n7:00-9:30 PM: Lancaster Living Poetry Museum On Stage in theater \n\n\n\n10:30 PM: Eraserhead in theater \n\n\n\nSUNDAY: \n\n\n\n11:00 AM: Drag Brunch with Plant Bingo in restaurant \n\n\n\n1:00-2:30 PM: What Would Jerry Do? in theater \n\n\n\n4:00-5:30 PM: Neilson Family Band in theater \n\n\n\n6:00 PM: Simpsons Trivia in restaurant \n\n\n\n6:30 PM: 1927 Silent Film Metropolis with Live Music by Laurie Reese showing in theater \n\n\n\n\n    more info
