SUMMARY:Mommy and Me Painting Class
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Mother’s Day with a special Mommy & Me Painting Class at Lancaster Art Vault on Saturday\, May 2nd from 2:00–4:30 PM. Led by Melissa Warren of Happily Ever Crafter LLC\, this fun and meaningful workshop invites mothers and children to create side-by-side\, each painting their own original piece that comes together as a beautiful diptych. Designed for all skill levels\, this guided experience focuses on creativity\, connection\, and making lasting memories. Leave with a one-of-a-kind collaborative artwork—and a shared experience to cherish. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
