SUMMARY:Mother's Day at Perfect Pots Greenhouse
DESCRIPTION:Our Strasburg Greenhouse is in full bloom\, and we’re ready to help you make Mother’s Day extra special with vibrant plants and creative experiences for all! Treat Mom—or that special someone—to a day of fun\, beauty\, and gardening joy at Perfect Pots.\n\nActivities Include:\n\nPaint a Pot for Mom – Kids can show their love by painting a custom pot for Mom! We provide all the supplies: paints\, brushes\, and a pot. The kid-friendly paint is permanent and weather-resistant\, so please dress for a fun\, creative mess! Cost: $10. Pre-registration is helpful but not required.\n\nBring Your Mom or Special Person to Our Summer Potting Workshop – Spend quality time together in our summer-themed planting workshop. You’ll both create stunning summer planters\, perfect for brightening up your garden or home. Registration required.\n\nPot on the Spot Gift for Mom – In need of a last-minute\, thoughtful gift? Our expert designers will help you select a pot and plants\, then plant it on the spot for you. It’s the perfect way to surprise Mom with a fresh\, living gift that will last.\n\nOur greenhouse is packed with vibrant summer plants\, ready to inspire gardeners of all levels. Whether you’re new to gardening or a seasoned pro\, we’ve got everything you need to create the perfect gift for Mom or a beautiful addition to her garden.\n\nJoin us for a day of family fun\, creativity\, and celebration as we honor the amazing moms and mothering figures in our lives. \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/mothers-day-at-perfect-pots-greenhouse/
LOCATION:Perfect Pots Greenhouse\, 745 Strasburg Pike\, Strasburg\, PA\, 17579\, United States
CATEGORIES:Festivals & Annual Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/04/54.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Perfect Pots":MAILTO:marketing@perfectpots.com
END:VEVENT
