SUMMARY:Summer Planter Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Design your own vibrant planter alongside our expert team at the Strasburg Greenhouse! Whether you’re sprucing up your porch\, patio\, or deck\, we’ll help you create the perfect summer oasis in a pot at our Planting Bar.\n\nIn this limited-seat event\, you’ll learn: \n\nPerfect Summer Plants – curate a planter with an ideal mix of heat-loving summer flowers.\n\nGarden Design Mastery – discover professional techniques for creating balanced designs that account for plant growth over the course of the summer months. \n\nPlanting Techniques – gain tips for planting your “thriller”\, “filler” and “spiller” plants like the pros!\n\nCare & Maintenance – walk away with inside tricks for keeping your newly created planter looking fantastic all summer long!\n\nWhether you’re a seasoned gardener or just starting out\, our team will guide you in creating beautiful summer planters that’ll bloom all season long. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/summer-planter-workshop/
