SUMMARY:2026 Open Streets Lancaster
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Rec’s 11th Annual Open Streets Lancaster event will temporarily close Water Street to motorized vehicles and open them to the Lancaster community. Our Lancaster event joins more than 130 Open Streets initiatives in the United States and Canada.\n\nOpen Streets Lancaster is different than a block party or street fair. It is part of a broad effort to encourage physical activity\, re-imagine the City as a place to walk and bike for transportation\, help people meet\, and steward meaningful social connections.\n\nHosted by Lancaster Rec and held in partnership with City of Lancaster and the Lancaster Bikes program\, Open Streets Lancaster is a free family-friendly event that temporarily transforms Water Street into a paved playground. Pedestrian traffic replaces car traffic and people of all ages\, abilities and backgrounds can uncover new interests\, discover their talents and improve their general well-being.\n\nThe route features activities promoting physical and mental health\, as well as local bands and musicians\, artists\, food trucks and opportunities to learn about non-profits and small businesses.\n\nOur event reimagines transportation and community connections throughout the City of Lancaster. Attendees are encouraged to walk\, bike\, blade\, and skate to the event and to meaningfully meet their neighbors. \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/2026-open-streets-lancaster/
LOCATION:North/Sout Water Street\, South Water Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/03/Screenshot_5-1-2026_113128_-1.avif
END:VEVENT
