SUMMARY:30th Annual LM Golf Tournament – May 12\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 30th Annual Lancaster Mennonite Golf Tournament to be held at Meadia Heights Golf Club\, 402 Golf Road\, Lancaster\, on Tuesday\, May 12\, 2026. All event proceeds support Christ-centered education at Lancaster Mennonite.\n\nCost: $150 per golfer\nCreate a womens\, mens\, mixed or senior foursome. Register as single or double and we will place you in a foursome for the day.  A mixed team is defined as a foursome with at least two women. A senior team must have three golfers who are age 65 or older.\n\nGolfers will have the opportunity to purchase mulligans and enter day of competitions. There will also be an exciting prize for any player who obtains a hole in one on our designated hole!\n\nTeam and individual skill prizes will be awarded after each round. Team prizes awarded for men\, women\, mixed and senior teams. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/30th-annual-lm-golf-tournament-may-12-2026/
